  <p class="dek">Grave 9760 took twenty minutes and gave a direct-line ancestor a place you could walk
    to. So the whole collection was swept &mdash; <b>298 entries</b> under Booyzen, Booysen, Booijzen,
    Daschner, Mountjoy and Lerena. Most are other families. <b>These are not</b>, and every one of them
    turns a year this archive was carrying into a day.</p>

